| Role | HEX |
|------|-----|
| Background | `#F7F8FA` |
| Sidebar | `#FFFFFF` |
| Cards | `#FFFFFF` |
| Border | `#E5E7EB` |
| Primary Text | `#111827` |
| Secondary | `#6B7280` |
| Muted | `#9CA3AF` |
| Danger | `#EF4444` |

## Dark Theme

| Role | HEX |
