## Mapping

- Page canvas → Background (`--canvas`: light `#F7F8FA` / dark `#111827`)
- Sidebar / header chrome → Sidebar (`--background`: light `#FFFFFF` / dark `#111827`)
- Cards / popovers → Cards (`--card`: light `#FFFFFF` / dark `#1E293B`)
- Card borders → Border (`--border`)
- Inset wells / chips on cards → Sidebar (`--muted` / `--accent` in dark = `#111827`)
- Headings / CTAs → Primary Text (`--primary` / `--foreground`)
- Body / descriptions → Muted in dark (`--muted-foreground` `#94A3B8`); Secondary `#CBD5E1` via `--secondary-foreground`
- Placeholders / hints → Muted (`--text-muted`)
- Errors / destructive actions → Danger (`--destructive` / `text-destructive` / `bg-danger` = `#EF4444`)

Do **not** introduce lime, navy, purple, or other accent hex outside this table. Legacy `brand-*` class names remap to Primary Text / Background / Cards.
